	TODO:
	- check the chords (real book).
	- check the tune (real book).
	- hear the tune to check that it is right and adjust the tempo.
	- bar 14: the beaming of the end of the bar (d, c-d-c triplet, b natural) is unclear; typed as quarter, sixteenth triplet, eighth.
	- bar 12: the book prints no natural on the d of the four sixteenths (typed as d flat); the New Real Book has d natural there.
	- bar 28: the last eighth has an unclear sign before it; typed as c.
	- bars 6, 7 and 31: the book draws a plain half note where the bar needs a dotted half; typed as a dotted half.
	- bar 29: the beaming of the a flat - b flat - a flat group is unclear; typed as two sixteenths and an eighth.
	REMARKS:
	- the book prints a circled 3 above the first ending; its meaning is not clear (play the head three times?).
	- the second ending is the 'Ending' the book prints under the last line.
